OL,3,GNEWSAWhat should Britain do with its
OL,4,Aempty department stores?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom Wolverhampton's Beatties building
OL,7,Fto Birmingham's former House of Fraser
OL,8,Fstore, the future of two prominent
OL,9,Fretail landmarks has reignited debate
OL,10,Fover how vacant department stores
OL,11,Fshould be reused.
OL,13,FIn Wolverhampton, the city council is
OL,14,Fpreparing legal action against the
OL,15,Fowners of the former Beatties building
OL,16,Fover the condition of the site, while
OL,17,Fin Birmingham a consultation has opened
OL,18,Fon proposals to redevelop the former
OL,19,FHouse of Fraser store, better known to
OL,20,Fmany as Rackham's.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
