OL,3,GNEWSAWhat should Britain do with its
OL,4,Aempty department stores?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a mix of homes, shops and
OL,7,Fcafes have been put forward for both
OL,8,Fsites, but heritage campaigners argue
OL,9,Fsuch buildings should be retained and
OL,10,Fadapted rather than lost.
OL,12,FCatherine Croft, of the Twentieth
OL,13,FCentury Society, said 20th Century
OL,14,Fbuildings could be valued in the same
OL,15,Fway as Victorian structures and that
OL,16,Fmany were "really interesting" and
OL,17,Fworth preserving.
